    "reviews": "\u201cAn incredibly funny game that will get you hooked and amazed in a way that few games can.\u201d<br />\r\nNavigames<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cAs amazing as it is funny, with a unique personality that's overwhelmingly charming.\u201d<br />\r\nHobby Consolas<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cInteresting strategy gameplay with a variety of units and heroes (...) The humorous writing and voice overs are excellent.\u201d<br />\r\nGideon's Gaming<br />\r\n",
